s=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Forging the Auroracrest tools</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.71.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><big><i>\"A heart, crystallized from the love that the Borealis provides to all of Oaklands.\"</i></big>\n</p><p>The <b>Heart of Borealis</b> can (rarely) be found anywhere in the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Icelands\" title=\"Icelands\">Icelands</a> biome when there's an aurora event happening (the polar lights in the sky).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Its a crystal-heart shaped object that emits sparkles and aurora-like lines.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\">Usage</span></h2>\n<p>Besides looking very cool, it can be combined with the <a href=\"/wiki/Icecrest_Axe\" title=\"Icecrest Axe\">Icecrest Axe</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Icecrest_Pickaxe\" title=\"Icecrest Pickaxe\">Pickaxe</a> to make them Auroracrest tools.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903003157\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\